OL,3,GNEWSAToy shop owner 'heartbroken' after
OL,4,AJellycat thefts                        
OL,6,FA toy shop owner has said she is       
OL,7,Fheartbroken after hundreds of          
OL,8,Fpounds-worth of stock was stolen from  
OL,9,Fher business in the space of a few     
OL,10,Fminutes.                               
OL,12,FBoos Toys in Poundbury, Dorchester,    
OL,13,Fposted a Facebook appeal after a group 
OL,14,Fof women and children appeared to help 
OL,15,Fthemselves to nearly #500-worth of     
OL,16,FJellycat toys.                         
OL,18,FFollowing the appeal, some of the items
OL,19,Fwere returned. But, after reviewing    
OL,20,FCCTV, it emerged more stock had been   
OL,21,Ftaken than originally thought.         
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
